OL,3,GNEWSA'There will always be a place for
OL,4,Athe Red Arrows'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former team leader of the Red
OL,7,FArrows said there will "always be a
OL,8,Fplace" for the aerobatic team, amid
OL,9,Ftalks over the replacement of the
OL,10,Fageing jets.
OL,12,FWing Commander Jon Bond, who was Red 1
OL,13,Ffor the fleet for the past three years,
OL,14,Fbowed out on Friday, his last day.
OL,16,F"I'm sure we'll see the red, white and
OL,17,Fblue for many years to come," Bond
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
