OL,3,GNEWSA'There will always be a place for
OL,4,Athe Red Arrows'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe current Hawk T1s - which have been
OL,7,Fflown by the Red Arrows since 1980 -
OL,8,Fare due to be retired in 2030, with the
OL,9,Fgovernment announcing in June that the
OL,10,Ffleet would get new jets as part of a
OL,11,F#15bn increase in military spending.
